# MUHIM: shu fayl bo'lmasa, `docker build` backend/.env (BOT_TOKEN, ADMIN_KEY)
# ni image ICHIGA nusxalab qo'yishi mumkin edi (Dockerfile "COPY backend/ ..."
# butun papkani oladi). Bu image keyin biror registry'ga push qilinsa,
# maxfiy qiymatlar oshkora bo'lib qoladi.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
backend/.env
backend/.env.*
!backend/.env.example

node_modules
backend/node_modules
backend/data
backend/logs
videos
.git
.gitignore
*.md
